    {"niche":"Nail Studio Owner","slug":"brand-kit-for-nail-studio-owners","colors":["Soft Pink (#F5E1E1)","White (#FFFFFF)","Rose Gold (#B76E79)","Sage (#B5C4B1)"],"fonts":["Playfair Display (headings — elegant, feminine serif with editorial polish)","Raleway (body — elegant geometric sans-serif with thin weight options)"],"palette_rationale":"Nail studio branding thrives on femininity, trend-awareness, and Instagram appeal. Soft pink creates warmth and approachability. Crisp white signals cleanliness and precision. Rose gold adds premium, photo-worthy sparkle. Sage provides a natural, calming counterbalance.","color_psychology":"Pink and rose gold are the dominant luxury-beauty colors of the 2020s — Instagram-native, aspirational, and universally flattering in photographs. White reinforces the clinical cleanliness essential for nail services.","font1_rationale":"Playfair Display's distinctive character and high contrast make studio names memorable and premium-feeling. It photographs beautifully — important for a visual-first industry.","font2_rationale":"Raleway's thin weight options create an elegant, fashion-forward impression. At regular weights, it provides excellent readability for service descriptions and pricing.","templates":["Service Menu — elegant, Instagram-ready design with nail art photography and clear pricing","Collection Launch Post — portfolio-optimized template for new season/collection reveals"],"template1_detail":"Your service menu is also an Instagram post. Design it to be photographed and shared — elegant presentation that makes clients want to screenshot and send to friends.","template2_detail":"New collections drive excitement and bookings. This template frames your nail art as editorial content — aspirational, beautiful, and immediately bookable."},
    {"niche":"Shopify Merchant","slug":"brand-kit-for-shopify-merchants","colors":["Navy Blue (#1B365D)","White (#FFFFFF)","Teal (#008080)","Warm Gray (#8B8581)"],"fonts":["Inter (headings — the most readable screen font, designed for digital commerce)","DM Sans (body — clean geometric sans-serif optimized for product descriptions)"],"palette_rationale":"E-commerce branding must balance trust with conversion. Navy blue is the most trusted color in brand psychology — essential for online purchases. White provides clean product presentation. Teal adds a modern, conversion-optimized accent (associated with trust and clarity). Warm gray supports without competing.","color_psychology":"Blue-based e-commerce brands see higher conversion rates in A/B testing — blue signals security, reliability, and professionalism. Teal stands out in the increasingly crowded blue e-commerce space while maintaining trust associations.","font1_rationale":"Inter was designed for screen readability. At every size from product titles to mobile checkout, it maintains perfect clarity.","font2_rationale":"DM Sans provides a clean, modern body font that lets product descriptions and details breathe. Excellent for information-dense product pages.","templates":["Product Page Layout — clean, conversion-optimized design with hero image, description, and buy section","Collection Banner — seasonal or category banner template for homepage and category pages"],"template1_detail":"Product pages convert browsers to buyers. This layout prioritizes product imagery, clear pricing, and friction-free purchase flow — all in your brand's visual language.","template2_detail":"Collection and category pages organize your catalog. Consistent banner design across collections creates a cohesive shopping experience that builds trust and encourages browsing."},
    {"niche":"Influencer","slug":"brand-kit-for-influencers","colors":["Signature Accent (brand-defining)","Clean White (#FFFFFF)","Warm Neutral (#F5F0E8)","Bold Contrast (#1A1A1A)"],"fonts":["Custom/Display (headings — distinctive, memorable, personality-forward)","Inter (body — clean, versatile, platform-optimized)"],"palette_rationale":"Influencer branding is personal branding. The palette centers on one signature color that becomes synonymous with the creator's identity — think of how specific colors are instantly associated with top creators. White provides a clean content canvas. Warm neutral adds lifestyle warmth. Bold contrast ensures visibility across all platforms.","color_psychology":"A signature color builds instant recognition across platforms. When followers see that specific shade, they know it's your content before reading a single word. This is the most powerful brand asset an influencer can build.","font1_rationale":"A distinctive display font becomes a visual signature. Combined with your signature color, it creates a recognizable brand identity that followers associate with your content quality and personality.","font2_rationale":"Inter ensures all supporting text — captions, details, calls to action — is perfectly readable on every device and platform.","templates":["Content Post Template — signature layout for your primary content format with brand colors and fonts","Media Kit — professional sponsorship package design with audience stats and collaboration options"],"template1_detail":"Your content template should be recognizable as yours within 0.5 seconds of appearing in a feed. Consistent framing, color treatment, and typography build the visual recognition that grows audiences.","template2_detail":"A professional media kit opens doors with brands. This template presents your audience data and collaboration value with the same visual polish as your content."},
    {"niche":"YouTuber","slug":"brand-kit-for-youtubers","colors":["Bold Primary (highly saturated)","White (#FFFFFF)","Dark Background (#0A0A0A)","Vibrant Accent (complementary)"],"fonts":["Bebas Neue (headings — bold, condensed, thumbnail-optimized)","Roboto (body — versatile, highly readable at all sizes)"],"palette_rationale":"YouTube branding lives and dies by thumbnail visibility. The palette is built for small-screen impact: a highly saturated primary color that pops at postage-stamp size, white for contrast, dark background for depth, and a vibrant accent for visual interest and click triggers.","color_psychology":"Thumbnails with high-saturation, high-contrast color schemes consistently outperform muted palettes in CTR tests. Bold colors trigger faster visual processing — the viewer's eye finds your thumbnail before they consciously decide to look.","font1_rationale":"Bebas Neue is the most thumbnail-friendly font available — bold, condensed, and impactful even at tiny sizes. It commands attention in YouTube's crowded thumbnail landscape.","font2_rationale":"Roboto provides perfect readability for video descriptions, end screens, and channel art. Universally supported, consistently rendered.","templates":["Thumbnail Template — high-CTR layout with expression zone, text zone, and brand color treatment","Channel Banner — cohesive channel art that matches thumbnail energy and reinforces brand"],"template1_detail":"Your thumbnail template should make creating consistent, high-CTR thumbnails as fast as possible. Expression zone, text zone, brand color treatment — plug in your content and publish.","template2_detail":"Channel art is your YouTube homepage. Match your thumbnail energy while providing channel information — upload schedule, content focus, value proposition."},
    {"niche":"Consultant","slug":"brand-kit-for-consultants","colors":["Navy Blue (#1B365D)","White (#FFFFFF)","Gold (#C99700)","Warm Gray (#8B8581)"],"fonts":["Georgia (headings — classic, trusted serif with professional authority)","Open Sans (body — clean, neutral sans-serif for data-heavy content)"],"palette_rationale":"Consulting branding must communicate authority, trust, and premium value. Navy blue is the most trusted color in business — associated with expertise and reliability. White ensures clarity in data-heavy deliverables. Gold signals premium positioning and successful outcomes. Warm gray provides professional support without distraction.","color_psychology":"Navy + gold is the most trusted color combination in professional services — used by top consulting firms for generations because it works. It communicates 'we are expensive because we are worth it' without saying a word.","font1_rationale":"Georgia was designed for authority and clarity. It's the typographic equivalent of a firm handshake — traditional enough to signal experience, modern enough to feel current.","font2_rationale":"Open Sans handles data-heavy content flawlessly. Charts, tables, bullet points — everything stays crisp and professional regardless of information density.","templates":["Proposal Cover — authoritative design that sets fee expectations before page one","Report Template — clean, data-optimized layout for findings and recommendations"],"template1_detail":"Your proposal cover sets the value expectation. Premium design signals premium fees. This template communicates expertise and results-orientation before the client reads a single word of your scope.","template2_detail":"Reports are your primary deliverable. Professional design that makes your analysis look as valuable as it is — clear data presentation, logical flow, executive-ready formatting."},
    {"niche":"Amazon Seller","slug":"brand-kit-for-amazon-sellers","colors":["Clean White (#FFFFFF)","Trust Blue (#1B73E8)","Dark Text (#111111)","Accent Orange (#FF9900)"],"fonts":["Inter (headings — screen-optimized for Amazon listing readability)","Roboto (body — versatile, Amazon-compatible, highly legible)"],"palette_rationale":"Amazon branding must be conversion-optimized within Amazon's visual ecosystem. White is essential for main images (Amazon requires RGB 255,255,255). Trust blue is the most-clicked color in Amazon's interface. Dark text ensures readability in search results. Accent orange matches Amazon's native CTA colors for visual harmony.","color_psychology":"Amazon shoppers make split-second decisions. Clean, high-contrast branding performs best in Amazon's dense visual environment. Simplicity and clarity convert better than creativity on this platform.","font1_rationale":"Inter provides maximum readability at the small sizes common in Amazon search results and product tiles — where your brand must be recognizable instantly.","font2_rationale":"Roboto's neutral character lets product information dominate. On Amazon, your product is the hero — typography should support, not compete.","templates":["Main Product Image — Amazon-compliant white background hero shot with consistent brand framing","A+ Content Module Set — brand story, feature highlights, and comparison chart in matching style"],"template1_detail":"Your main image is the single most important conversion element on Amazon. Clean, compliant, and consistent — every product in your catalog should share visual DNA so customers recognize your brand across search results.","template2_detail":"A+ Content can boost conversion 5-10%. Consistent brand presentation across all A+ modules builds the trust that converts comparison shoppers into buyers."},
    {"niche":"Podcaster","slug":"brand-kit-for-podcasters","colors":["Bold Primary (attention-grabbing)","Dark Background (#1A1A1A)","White (#FFFFFF)","Warm Accent (personality-appropriate)"],"fonts":["Oswald (headings — bold, condensed, highly visible at tiny podcast app sizes)","Lato (body — warm, readable sans-serif for show notes and social)"],"palette_rationale":"Podcast branding must work at 55x55 pixels — the size podcast art appears in Apple Podcasts. Bold primary color for instant recognition. Dark background for contrast. White for typography visibility. Warm accent for personality and genre signaling.","color_psychology":"Podcast discovery happens at thumbnail size. Bold, high-contrast cover art is 3x more likely to be tapped than muted, complex designs. The palette must communicate your show's genre and energy in a postage stamp.","font1_rationale":"Oswald's condensed bold forms remain readable at the smallest sizes. Critical when your show title must be legible at 55x55 pixels in a podcast app.","font2_rationale":"Lato brings warmth to show notes and social media — balancing the bold podcast art with approachable supporting content that builds community.","templates":["Episode Artwork Template — consistent show-branded artwork with episode-specific title and guest","Audiogram Template — social-media-optimized audio visualization with quote and show branding"],"template1_detail":"Every episode should be instantly recognizable as yours. This template maintains show branding while accommodating episode-specific content — title, guest, episode number.","template2_detail":"Audiograms turn audio into shareable social content. Bold quotes, waveform visualization, show branding — designed to stop the scroll and drive listens."},
    {"niche":"Freelancer","slug":"brand-kit-for-freelancers","colors":["Signature Color (memorable, personality-reflecting)","Clean White (#FFFFFF)","Dark Charcoal (#2D2D2D)","Subtle Accent (complementary)"],"fonts":["DM Serif Display (headings — distinctive, memorable serif with personality)","Inter (body — clean, professional, universally readable)"],"palette_rationale":"Freelancer branding is personal branding. One signature color that becomes your visual identifier — memorable, distinctive, consistently applied. White provides a clean canvas for portfolio work. Dark charcoal for professional text. Subtle accent for visual interest without distraction.","color_psychology":"A signature color is the most cost-effective personal brand investment a freelancer can make. Consistent application across proposals, portfolio, social media, and invoices creates a professional impression that commands higher rates.","font1_rationale":"DM Serif Display has character without being quirky — distinctive enough to be memorable, professional enough for client communications.","font2_rationale":"Inter ensures every client communication is flawlessly readable. Proposals, contracts, reports — clean, professional, invisible in the best way.","templates":["Proposal Template — professional client-facing document with project scope, timeline, and pricing","Portfolio Case Study — project showcase with challenge, solution, and results format"],"template1_detail":"Your proposal is a sales document. Professional design signals professional rates. This template presents your value with the polish that justifies premium pricing.","template2_detail":"Case studies prove capability. Consistent format makes your portfolio scannable and impressive — each project builds on the credibility of the last."},
